  "description": "YITAMOTOR 48\" Skid Steer Pallet forks Blades. This skid steer pallet forks blade has 4000 lbs Bearing Capacity, Can easily and quickly haul lumber, and firewood, move fence posts, hay bales, etc.\nFitment\nThe frontier pallet fork fits a slotted skid steer pallet fork frame for use with Kubota, John Deere, Bobcat skid steers loaders tractors.\nCompatible with Universal Skid Steer Quick Attach (SSQA) system.\nFor your safety, professional installation is recommended.\nFeatures\nAdjustable Pallet Fork Blades:Pallet fork frame is a quick connect skid steer that can be directly installed to the machine. The pallet fork blade can be freely moved on the skid steer frame, and the distance can be adjusted within a 17\"-37\" range on the frame.\nLoading Capacity:The 4000 lb load capacity of the pallet fork is enough to handle most problems. Don't worry about the frame bending or deforming.\nRust Resistant Coating:All steel design plus black rust-resistant coated finishing prevents rusting for continued use throughout the seasons.\nExtensive Compatibility: Suitable for most loaders and tractors; Compatible with Bobcat Skid Steer, New Holland and Kubota tractors; Ideal for handling most farm, factory, warehouse and construction site work.\nSpecifications and Reliable Service: Package includes: 1x pallet fork frame, 2 x pallet fork blades.",
